WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.700
Nero had to help Duke.

2
00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.360
Suddenly he got an idea!

3
00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:23.380
He puffed himself up.

4
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.800
Then he sat—just like Duke.

5
00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:32.220
Dev scratched his head. "Are you trying to look like Duke?"

6
00:00:32.828 --> 00:00:39.154
Pam raised an eyebrow. "I doubt your dog is . . ."

7
00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:41.480
Nero pretended to wrestle.

8
00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:50.120
Pam stared at Nero. "Is your dog playing charades?"

9
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:57.800
Dev laughed nervously. "Oh, uh, I don't think . . ."

10
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.219
Nero pretended to fall.

11
00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:06.518
"He's definitely playing charades!" Pam said.

12
00:01:06.519 --> 00:01:13.425
Dev gasped. "I get it now—Duke fell!"

13
00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:15.940
Nero limped around.

14
00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:21.230
"And Duke hurt his leg!" Dev guessed.

15
00:01:21.231 --> 00:01:24.643
"Woof!" Nero barked.

16
00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:30.820
"Wow," Pam said. "You two really understand each other!"

17
00:01:35.423 --> 00:01:38.642
Nero ran back to Duke.

18
00:01:38.643 --> 00:01:43.120
Dev and Pam followed him.

19
00:01:43.121 --> 00:01:46.952
"Woof!" Duke barked.

20
00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:52.280
"Don't worry, Duke." Pam got into the muddy ditch.

21
00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:54.480
"I'll help you out."

22
00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:03.080
Pam tried to lift the log. "Grr! It's too heavy."

23
00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:06.640
Dev got into the ditch and helped.

24
00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:12.020
Finally they lifted the log.

25
00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:16.060
Pam grunted. "Come on out, Duke."

26
00:02:16.582 --> 00:02:20.856
But Duke didn't move—he just whined.

27
00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:23.620
"He's hurt," Pam said.

28
00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:27.040
"But I can't lift him while holding this log."

29
00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:31.320
"Nero!" Dev called. "Come!"

30
00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:34.260
Nero slid into the ditch.

31
00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:38.200
"Grab Duke's collar," Dev said.

32
00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:42.060
Nero grabbed Duke's collar with his teeth.

33
00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:45.860
He pulled Duke to safety.

34
00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:50.040
Pam and Dev dropped the log. Splat!

35
00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:55.280
Pam picked up Duke. "I was wrong, Dev.

36
00:02:56.220 --> 00:03:01.340
You and Nero have great communication—and a great bond."

37
00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:04.960
Dev and Nero looked at each other happily.

38
00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:08.880
"We sure do!" Nero thought.

39
00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:22.580
Back at home, Dad frowned. "Nero is getting mud everywhere!

40
00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:25.100
He needs more classes."

41
00:03:26.879 --> 00:03:33.950
"Nope." Dev handed Dad a note. "Nero graduated!"

42
00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:38.530
"What?" Dad read Pam's note.

43
00:03:38.717 --> 00:03:42.382
Dev and Nero have great communication.

44
00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:46.190
It's as if Nero understands human speech!

45
00:03:47.596 --> 00:03:53.123
Nero wagged his tail and stared at the Doggie Doodles.

46
00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:55.170
"Maybe I'll get a treat!"
